#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Apply the uploaded DRA-style district statistics CSVs to only the targeted
North Carolina Election Atlas JSON slices.

Targets only these contest/year combinations:
  - 2004 President
  - 2008 Governor
  - 2024 President on the 2026 congressional lines

Behavior matches scripts/calibrate_district_slices_from_stats_csv.py:
  - keeps each JSON district's total_votes fixed
  - rebalances dem_votes / rep_votes / other_votes to match CSV shares
  - recomputes margin, margin_pct, winner, and competitiveness color

Run from the repository root:
  python scripts/apply_targeted_dra_calibration_uploads.py

Use --dry-run to preview without writing JSON files.
"""

